<title>POLAND: Kable full 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Kable full 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kable SA preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
